TYPE UDT_PusherIO
  ROOTID 0
  MEMBERS
    Step : Int
    Fitted : Bool
    Enable : Bool
    AutoStartSignal : Bool COMMENT "In: C-115 handshake vocabulary (owner ruling 2026-07-17, task 09, resolution 2) - external run permission, caller-asserted, named after the site's real chained-permissive pattern (FB_MotorFwdRevSystem.IO.AutoStartSignal), not doc 06's illustrative name. Unwired by FC_ControlMain for now - no established caller need for this integration; C-115 requires the member regardless. Distinct from Enable above (FB-computed, Fitted AND Mode<>0) - that's this block's own internal readiness gate, not the external permission this member carries."
    Mode : Int
    HopperHighLevel : Bool
    ManualCycleCmd : Bool
    ParkCmd : Bool COMMENT "In (FC_ControlMain, from the sequencer's PusherParkCmd): plant pre-start park request - while set, an idle off-home ram reparks to home after the pre-motion warning (REQ-045). With a live cycle request, one of the only two repark occasions (owner ruling 2026-07-16); jog release deliberately leaves the ram where it stopped (REQ-039)."
    CycleInhibit : Bool COMMENT "In (FC_ControlMain, from the sequencer's PusherCycleInhibitCmd): the plant has a live stop reason - no cycle may launch (CycleRequest gated) and an in-flight cycle aborts to Retract and parks (CycleAbort). Hand-jog is deliberately exempt (owner amendment 2026-07-16, REQ-040): only the mode-0 force (stop button/unhealthy) blocks jogging."
    JogExtendCmd : Bool
    JogRetractCmd : Bool
    HomeLimit : Bool
    FullTravelLimit : Bool
    HighPressure : Bool
    PowerPackRunningFB : Bool
    FaultReset : Bool
    EndTravelTimeout : Real
    ParkedTimeout : Real
    EndTravelHoldTime : Real
    PumpRunOnTime : Real
    JogWarningTime : Real
    PressureTripConfirmTime : Real
    PressureClearResumeDelay : Real
    PressureTripCountThreshold : Int
    Cycling : Bool COMMENT "Out: this block's C-115 running-equivalent (owner ruling 2026-07-17, task 09 resolution 2) - Step <> 0. Already wired (NETWORK 13); recognized as satisfying C-115's running slot under this block's own established name rather than duplicated under the generic vocabulary."
    Blocked : Bool
    EndTravelTimeoutFault : Bool
    ParkedTimeoutFault : Bool
    BothSwitchesFault : Bool
    RunPowerPack : Bool
    Extend : Bool
    Retract : Bool
    JogPreStartSounder : Bool
